# Optional. Your SLNG project UUID, from the project's Settings page in the
# dashboard (https://app.slng.ai). It prefills the Project ID field, and the demo
# sends it as the X-SLNG-Project-Id header to pick the project that requests are
# billed and limited under. Copy this file to .env.local and restart `npm run dev`.
# The value is built into the page, so leave it unset on hosted deployments.
SLNG_PROJECT_ID=
